{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And your spoil is gathered.</b> The spoil of the nations, for the sign of the kaf is on account of Israel, that the king of Assyria exiled [him]." "<b>Gevim.</b> The Aramaic translation of arbè." "<b>Shokek.</b> Like oseif. Some say it is like it: ובן משק ביתי (Genesis 15:2). In my opinion it is like it in the book of Joel: ישתקשקון (Nahum 2:5), and it too concerns the arbè."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:56:27.277098568Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}